<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>GitFlow Studio - Gestiona tu codigo como un equipo elite</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #101828;
      --muted: #667085;
      --line: rgba(16, 24, 40, .12);
      --lime: #b7ff5c;
      --blue: #3b82f6;
      --coral: #ff6b57;
      --violet: #7c3aed;
      --paper: #ffffff;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: #ffffff;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    .marketing-nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .35);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .brand-badge {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: inline-grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #101828, #3b82f6 58%, #b7ff5c);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(59, 130, 246, .28);
      animation: logo-pop 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .nav-link {
      color: rgba(16, 24, 40, .72);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 92vh;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      padding: 9rem 0 5rem;
      isolation: isolate;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8, 13, 25, .92) 0%, rgba(8, 13, 25, .68) 45%, rgba(8, 13, 25, .18) 100%),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551434678-e076c223a692?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=85") center/cover;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto 0 0;
      height: 170px;
      background: linear-gradient(0deg, #ffffff, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .hero-orbit {
      position: absolute;
      right: clamp(1rem, 6vw, 7rem);
      bottom: 7rem;
      width: min(38vw, 440px);
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .18);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: rotate-slow 18s linear infinite;
    }

    .hero-orbit::before,
    .hero-orbit::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .24);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, .22);
    }

    .hero-orbit::before {
      top: 9%;
      left: 8%;
      background: rgba(183, 255, 92, .22);
    }

    .hero-orbit::after {
      right: 4%;
      bottom: 14%;
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, .24);
    }

    .floating-chip {
      position: absolute;
      right: clamp(1rem, 8vw, 10rem);
      bottom: 15rem;
      z-index: 1;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .55rem;
      padding: .85rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 18px;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .22);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);
      animation: float-card 4.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .5rem;
      padding: .45rem .8rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .28);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      animation: rise .7s ease both;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    .display-font {
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 920px;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7.6rem);
      line-height: .92;
      font-weight: 700;
      animation: rise .8s ease .1s both;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 680px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82);
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
      animation: rise .8s ease .2s both;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      animation: rise .8s ease .3s both;
    }

    .cta-primary {
      background: var(--lime);
      color: #101828;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: .95rem 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(183, 255, 92, .28);
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    }

    .cta-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 56px rgba(183, 255, 92, .38);
      background: #c5ff75;
      color: #101828;
    }

    .cta-secondary {
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .32);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: .95rem 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .cta-secondary:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .6);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .16);
    }

    .metric-strip {
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .metric-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 1.3rem;
      box-shadow: 0 22px 70px rgba(16, 24, 40, .13);
      animation: lift-in .7s ease both;
    }

    .metric-card strong {
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .section-pad {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

    .section-kicker {
      color: var(--violet);
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: .78rem;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
    }

    .big-heading {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .feature-card {
      height: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 1.6rem;
      background: #ffffff;
      transition: transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease, border-color .22s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, .35);
      box-shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(16, 24, 40, .12);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
      color: #101828;
      background: var(--lime);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      transition: transform .25s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover .feature-icon {
      transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1.08);
    }

    .workflow {
      background: #101828;
      color: #ffffff;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .workflow::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 560px;
      height: 560px;
      right: -190px;
      top: -140px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59, 130, 246, .55), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0) 66%);
    }

    .workflow-image {
      min-height: 520px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(16, 24, 40, .12), rgba(16, 24, 40, .12)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1500&q=85") center/cover;
      box-shadow: 0 34px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35);
      animation: soft-zoom 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    .step {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .15);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .06);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      transition: transform .22s ease, border-color .22s ease, background .22s ease;
    }

    .step:hover {
      transform: translateX(8px);
      border-color: rgba(183, 255, 92, .38);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
    }

    .audience-card {
      min-height: 290px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 1.4rem;
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: end;
      overflow: hidden;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .audience-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(16, 24, 40, .88), rgba(16, 24, 40, .12));
    }

    .audience-card > * {
      position: relative;
    }

    .audience-card {
      transition: transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease;
    }

    .audience-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px) scale(1.01);
      box-shadow: 0 26px 70px rgba(16, 24, 40, .18);
    }

    .pricing {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f5f8ff 100%);
    }

    .pricing-card {
      height: 100%;
      position: relative;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(16, 24, 40, .08);
      transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease, border-color .25s ease;
    }

    .pricing-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, .42);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(16, 24, 40, .14);
    }

    .pricing-card.featured {
      color: #ffffff;
      background:
        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(16, 24, 40, .98), rgba(59, 130, 246, .9)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559136555-9303baea8ebd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85") center/cover;
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .24);
      transform: translateY(-14px);
    }

    .pricing-card.featured:hover {
      transform: translateY(-22px);
    }

    .pricing-card.featured .muted,
    .pricing-card.featured .price-note {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .72);
    }

    .plan-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .4rem;
      padding: .35rem .65rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #101828;
      background: var(--lime);
      font-size: .76rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
    }

    .price {
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .price-note {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .9rem;
    }

    .feature-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: .85rem;
    }

    .feature-list li {
      display: flex;
      gap: .65rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .feature-list i {
      color: var(--success);
      margin-top: .12rem;
    }

    .featured .feature-list i {
      color: var(--lime);
    }

    .comparison-table {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(16, 24, 40, .07);
    }

    .comparison-table table {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .comparison-table th {
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .comparison-table td,
    .comparison-table th {
      padding: 1rem;
      border-color: rgba(16, 24, 40, .08);
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(26px);
      transition: opacity .75s ease, transform .75s ease;
    }

    .reveal.is-visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .delay-1 { transition-delay: .08s; animation-delay: .08s; }
    .delay-2 { transition-delay: .16s; animation-delay: .16s; }
    .delay-3 { transition-delay: .24s; animation-delay: .24s; }

    .audience-one {
      background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85");
    }

    .audience-two {
      background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85");
    }

    .audience-three {
      background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85");
    }

    .final-cta {
      border-radius: 34px;
      color: #ffffff;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16, 24, 40, .96), rgba(124, 58, 237, .88)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85") center/cover;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .pulse {
      animation: pulse 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes rise {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(18px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      50% {
        transform: scale(1.05);
      }
    }

    @keyframes float-card {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(-1deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-16px) rotate(2deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes rotate-slow {
      to {
        transform: rotate(360deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes logo-pop {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-2px) rotate(-6deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes lift-in {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(24px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes soft-zoom {
      from {
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      to {
        transform: scale(1.025);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
      .hero {
        min-height: 86vh;
        padding-top: 7rem;
      }

      .metric-strip {
        transform: none;
        padding-top: 1rem;
      }

      .workflow-image {
        min-height: 340px;
      }

      .hero-orbit,
      .floating-chip {
        display: none;
      }

      .pricing-card.featured {
        transform: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-orbit"></div>
    <div class="floating-chip"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill text-warning"></i><span class="fw-bold">Deploy mental: listo</span></div>
    <div class="container-xl">
      <span class="eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> Version control, pero vendido como deberia</span>
      <h1>Convierte tu repositorio en el centro de mando del equipo.</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy mt-4 mb-4">GitFlow Studio simula una plataforma moderna para organizar repositorios, issues, ramas, commits y colaboradores con una experiencia simple, visual y lista para presentar.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="btn cta-primary pulse" href="account-create.html"><i class="bi bi-rocket-takeoff me-2"></i>Crear cuenta gratis</a>
        <a class="btn cta-secondary" href="login.html"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-2"></i>Ya tengo acceso</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="metric-strip">
    <div class="container-xl">
      <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="metric-card delay-1">
            <strong>10x</strong>
            <p class="muted mb-0">mas claridad sobre que se esta construyendo y quien lo esta moviendo.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="metric-card delay-2">
            <strong>5 min</strong>
            <p class="muted mb-0">para crear cuenta, repo, issue y rama de trabajo en una demo navegable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="metric-card delay-3">
            <strong>100%</strong>
            <p class="muted mb-0">enfocado en entender Git desde interfaces cercanas a herramientas reales.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="beneficios" class="section-pad">
    <div class="container-xl">
      <div class="row align-items-end g-4 mb-4">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <div class="section-kicker mb-2">Beneficios</div>
          <h2 class="big-heading mb-0 reveal">Menos caos. Mas entregas. Mejor historial.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <p class="lead muted mb-0">La landing vende una plataforma ficticia, pero cada modulo conecta con conceptos reales de Git para aprenderlos navegando.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
          <article class="feature-card reveal">
            <span class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-journal-code"></i></span>
            <h3 class="h5">Repositorios claros</h3>
            <p class="muted mb-0">Centraliza codigo, README, ramas y actividad del proyecto en una vista facil de explicar.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
          <article class="feature-card reveal delay-1">
            <span class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-record-circle"></i></span>
            <h3 class="h5">Issues accionables</h3>
            <p class="muted mb-0">Convierte bugs, mejoras y dudas en tareas con contexto, prioridad y responsables.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
          <article class="feature-card reveal delay-2">
            <span class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i></span>
            <h3 class="h5">Ramas sin miedo</h3>
            <p class="muted mb-0">Muestra como aislar trabajo nuevo, revisar cambios y proteger la rama principal.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
          <article class="feature-card reveal delay-3">
            <span class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-people"></i></span>
            <h3 class="h5">Equipos alineados</h3>
            <p class="muted mb-0">Gestiona permisos, colaboradores y responsabilidades con una narrativa visual simple.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="flujo" class="workflow section-pad">
    <div class="container-xl position-relative">
      <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="workflow-image reveal"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="section-kicker text-info mb-2">Flujo demo</div>
          <h2 class="big-heading mb-4 reveal">Del primer commit a una entrega revisada.</h2>
          <div class="d-grid gap-3">
            <div class="step reveal">
              <div class="fw-bold mb-1"><i class="bi bi-1-circle me-2 text-info"></i>Crea un repositorio</div>
              <div class="text-white-50">Inicia el proyecto con nombre, descripcion, visibilidad y README.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal delay-1">
              <div class="fw-bold mb-1"><i class="bi bi-2-circle me-2 text-info"></i>Abre un issue</div>
              <div class="text-white-50">Registra el problema, asigna prioridad y deja claro el criterio de cierre.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal delay-2">
              <div class="fw-bold mb-1"><i class="bi bi-3-circle me-2 text-info"></i>Trabaja en una rama</div>
              <div class="text-white-50">Separa cambios, revisa commits y prepara la integracion con main.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a class="btn cta-primary mt-4" href="repository-create.html"><i class="bi bi-journal-plus me-2"></i>Crear primer repositorio</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="equipos" class="section-pad">
    <div class="container-xl">
      <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 780px;">
        <div class="section-kicker mb-2">Publico objetivo</div>
        <h2 class="big-heading">Hecho para mostrar, vender y ensenar trabajo tecnico.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="audience-card audience-one reveal">
            <h3 class="h4">Estudiantes fullstack</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 text-white-50">Aprenden Git con pantallas reconocibles, acciones concretas y ejemplos de equipo.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="audience-card audience-two reveal delay-1">
            <h3 class="h4">Equipos junior</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 text-white-50">Practican repositorios, issues, ramas y permisos antes de ir a produccion.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="audience-card audience-three reveal delay-2">
            <h3 class="h4">Mentores y docentes</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 text-white-50">Presentan conceptos de colaboracion tecnica con una demo visual y navegable.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="precios" class="pricing section-pad">
    <div class="container-xl">
      <div class="row align-items-end g-4 mb-5">
